{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"<@!346493235948158977> How are you faring?","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:42:04.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737062210303557682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Traxim shakes his head and looks less dazed. That doesn’t mean he stops holding the taco in front of his face. “Oh, hullo Archivist. I’ve been okay other than a few moments in the gun bays last night.”","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:44:09.349000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737062732322570260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Ah yes, I am glad to finally be past the Koi barrier. I've been meaning to ask if the Captain can surface the sub to get some sun on OUR faces. I MISS THE SUN!","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:45:07.277000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-26T21:45:25.951000Z","id":"737062975290212453","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"“Some sunlight would be nice. But this vehicle has many curious devices to distract one from missing it too much.” He squints at a chunk of fish and shakes his head slowly.","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:48:03.552000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737063714640887819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"Tell me, I head that a colonist passed away in his sleep. Do you know anything about it?\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:49:17.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737064026021822484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"“I hadn’t heard, I have been distracted today. Do you know who it was?” This news was a little surprising and he was worried they had missed one of the boarding party last night.","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:51:04.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737064471884988430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"\"I was told it was one of the Winged Colonists. But word seldom travels into my sanctum. I fear that the Golden dawn's influence has followed us from London. There is a reliable combat medic name Kiln that you maybe familiar with. We should have her examine the body before we give him a proper burial.\"","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:53:35.816000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737065108257374268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Traxim thought for a moment, trying to remember who had wings. “I hope it wasn’t Brother Rah.” The idea of an agency with that kind of power to commit evil following them visibly upset him. “Yes, I know Sister Kiln. Has the body not been examined yet?”","created_at":"2020-07-26T21:56:57.309000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737065953380007967","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
